tainless-steel-casing-submersible-sewage30067424275.jpg\"/></span></li><li><span><img alt=\"\" bimg=\"/uploads/201816806/stainless-steel-casing-submersible-sewage37478133858.jpg\" onmousemove=\"preview(this);\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/stainless-steel-casing-submersible-sewage37478133858.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Stainless Steel Casing Submersible Sewage Pump</h1>\n<p>stainless steel casing submersible sewage pump Established in 1998, JIADI Pump has been continually expanding to encompass any water handling need that customers may have. We now has become one of the excellent pump companies in Zhejiang and manufacture pumps like stainless steel casing...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52512865\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271131481850372.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>stainless steel casing submersible sewage pump</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271131503067183.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Established in 1998, JIADI Pump has been continually expanding to encompass any water handling need that customers may have. We now has become one of the excellent pump companies in Zhejiang and manufacture pumps like stainless steel casing submersible sewage pump and so on.</p><p><strong>1. Product Details</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">Horsepower (HP)</p></td><td width=\"374\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\">1-1.8</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"175\"><p style=\"text-align:left;\