></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271134136572018.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img alt=\"图片111.jpg\" height=\"1141\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201809171406259285016.jpg\" style=\"width: 719px; height: 1141px;\" title=\"图片111.jpg\" width=\"719\"/></p><p><strong>4. Company Profile</strong></p><p>JIADI Pump Industry is the integrity of high quality pump, professional design and manufacture team as well as reliable and responsible sale team. Our pumps provide maximum performance in a compact footprint. We proudly represent manufacturers of superior products and are confident we can fulfill your equipment needs. Our goal is to offer quality products and service at a competitive price.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271135095043857.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>5. Why Choose Us</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271135174591045.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. Package and Delivery</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271135185278076.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image017(001).jpg\"/></p><p>Trade terms: FOB, CIF, CFR (CNF), etc</p><p>Port: Ningbo, Lianyungang, Shanghai</p><p>Lead time: Around 20 to 30 days</p><p>Shipment: By air, by sea or by express on the basis of the quantity of your quantity.</p><p>Packing: Plywood box or Carton with plastic foam inside the package</p><p><strong>7. Product Application</strong></p><p>Submersible sewage pumps widely used in agriculture, mine, environment protection and industry, such as drainage slurry, waste water.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808271135243696902.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image019(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>8. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the scale of your company?</strong></p><p>A: JIADI Pump Industry covers an area of 7,500㎡ and